# Groq API Keys Configuration
# Get your API keys from: https://console.groq.com/keys
# 
# You need 5 different Groq API keys to avoid rate limits
# Each functionality uses a dedicated API key:
# 1. GROQ_API_KEY_1 - for document summarization
# 2. GROQ_API_KEY_2 - for risk analysis
# 3. GROQ_API_KEY_3 - for text simplification
# 4. GROQ_API_KEY_4 - for document comparison
# 5. GROQ_API_KEY_5 - for Q&A chat

GROQ_API_KEY_1=gsk_your_summarization_key_here
GROQ_API_KEY_2=gsk_your_risk_analysis_key_here
GROQ_API_KEY_3=gsk_your_simplification_key_here
GROQ_API_KEY_4=gsk_your_comparison_key_here
GROQ_API_KEY_5=gsk_your_chat_key_here

# Tip: You can use the same API key for all 5 if you have a high rate limit
# or create 5 different free accounts to maximize throughput
